ShopeEasy– E-Commerce Shopping Website

## Project Overview
ShopeEasy is a modern, responsive e-commerce shopping website designed to provide users with a smooth and convenient online shopping experience. It features a clean green-and-cream design with an attractive product layout and easy navigation.

## Features
- Responsive homepage and navigation.
- Product listing with images and details.
- Product search and browsing.
- Add to cart functionality.
- Wishlist functionality.
- Shopping cart management.
- Checkout and order placement.
- Simulated payment flow.
- Order confirmation.
- LocalStorage support to retain cart and wishlist data.

## Technologies
- Figma
- Figma Make
- HTML, CSS and JavaScript (generated implementation)

